<title>HUNGARY: Domus sales, profits down in 1996.</title>
<headline>Domus sales, profits down in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-Dec 1996   1996 results as</p>
<p>							   percentage of 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	127.6		48.17</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit	  113.3		57.83</p>
<p>    Group net sales	     4,660.7		92.53</p>
<p>    Group other revenue	    63.7	     105.82</p>
<p>    Material expenditures     3,454.1		90.81</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditures	579.7	     103.54</p>
<p>    Depreciation		    119.2	     108.58</p>
<p>    Other costs		     282.0	     125.19</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    161.8	     120.6</p>
<p>    Net financial income	    5.8 loss	  8.71</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	    28.7	     103.53</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure	34.5		36.38</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary income	8.5 loss	 57.83</p>
<p>NOTE - Domus Kereskedelmi Rt is a furniture retailer, member of the Fotex-group. The figures are consolidated but are not audited.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
